# Simulation stimulus/expected vectors: bulk data regenerated by the sim's own
# gen_*.py script. Filter COEFFICIENTS (*_coefs.hex) are NOT ignored -- they are
# what the shipped hardware filters with, so they are tracked.
programmable_logic/sim/*_samples.hex
programmable_logic/sim/*_exp_*.hex

# Python bytecode cache
__pycache__/
*.pyc
